        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lakes%2C_Las_Vegas",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Nestled near the Spring Mountains, The Lakes sits close to the Red Rock Canyon National Conservation Area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lakes%2C_Las_Vegas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Sahara, a large man‑made lake, serves as the community’s centerpiece and namesake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Lakes%2C_Las_Vegas",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "When first conceived, planners intended two lakes, but the project was scaled back to a single one.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
